  "pacing": "60 slides. Open with the Paris 2024 race, finish photograph, official OMEGA scan and classroom stopwatch. Follow Tsumura 4–10 for brief density/CDF background, 15–18 for normal distributions and standardization, and 20–26 for table reading. Use ramen only as a hypothetical shape-and-area illustration, without deriving a coefficient or doing curved-area arithmetic. Concentrate on AL preparation with 8 z-score/table challenges including a closing past-exam problem, protected worked answers and no homework cell answers. Bilingual narration follows the revised pages.",
